    },
    "html": "\n  <div class=\"hero-meta\">\n    <span class=\"level-badge\" data-level=\"3\">Level 3 - Intermediate</span><span class=\"time\">25 min</span>\n    <span class=\"chip warn\">Medium</span><span class=\"chip accent\">Backtracking - combinations with reuse</span>\n    <a class=\"chip\" href=\"https://leetcode.com/problems/combination-sum/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">LC 39</a>\n  </div>\n  <h1>Combination Sum</h1>\n  <p class=\"lead\">Depth-first search over \"which value next\", where the next value may only come from the current index onward: recurse with <code>i</code> (reuse allowed) not <code>i + 1</code>, and never look back, so each multiset is built in exactly one order. Sort first and break as soon as a value exceeds what is left.</p>\n"
  },
